WEBVTT

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:22.272
<i>One of the absolute-defense cities,</i>
<i>Neo Liang, was destroyed by a plague.</i>

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.275
These are the refugees who fled.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:29.363
There are likely carriers of the disease
among them.

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.323
They would be a detriment.

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:35.786
That's exactly why
not helping them would be inhumane.

00:00:36.787 --> 00:00:38.455
Then we'll have to find a solution.

00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:57.266
It won't hurt. It's a painless needle.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.394
Come on, dear. Please.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.861
Touch!

00:01:10.571 --> 00:01:12.656
Touch!

00:01:12.948 --> 00:01:14.283
Touch!

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.326
Touch!

00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:18.370
Touch!

00:01:19.121 --> 00:01:20.831
Touch!

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.626
-See, you did it!
-Here

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:26.295
Thanks for that.

00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:29.464
No problem at all.

00:01:30.173 --> 00:01:33.427
Cain, you're good with kids.

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:36.346
Are you trying to say
I don't look like I would be?

00:01:36.847 --> 00:01:38.015
Well, you know.

00:01:39.057 --> 00:01:41.727
I thought I could use
complex system network theory

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:43.478
on the spread of the disease.

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:47.733
But they're only letting me take
blood samples for vaccine development.

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:50.611
Huh? Cain?

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:54.906
Have you seen this mother and child?

00:02:00.203 --> 00:02:01.204
Sorry.

00:02:08.337 --> 00:02:09.755
Hey, you.

00:02:16.553 --> 00:02:18.096
Help me!

00:03:57.654 --> 00:04:00.907
The Red Death Reaper

00:04:07.205 --> 00:04:10.751
And that's how you die
when you get Red Death.

00:04:11.126 --> 00:04:13.170
Query Half Body Rash,

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:14.880
Q.H.B.R.,

00:04:15.464 --> 00:04:16.965
commonly known as the Red Death.

00:04:17.299 --> 00:04:21.887
Since it attacks the nervous system
of the spinal cord like shingles,

00:04:22.137 --> 00:04:26.266
the symptoms always appear
on either the right or left side.

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:29.102
The incubation period is unknown.

00:04:30.437 --> 00:04:34.357
The infection causes intense pain,
organ failure,

00:04:34.608 --> 00:04:38.195
and death within one hour.
Once infected, the fatality rate

00:04:38.445 --> 00:04:40.322
is almost 100 percent.

00:04:41.323 --> 00:04:45.035
That is exactly why you can't let a plague
inside the city walls.

00:04:46.286 --> 00:04:49.456
All we can do right now
is block all routes into the city.

00:04:50.081 --> 00:04:54.461
Then why did Leon and Cain
leave the city?

00:04:55.003 --> 00:04:57.881
It's so we might
curb the spread of the disease

00:04:58.548 --> 00:05:00.258
in the event it enters the city.

00:05:01.259 --> 00:05:05.263
But... isn't there any way to save them?

00:05:12.771 --> 00:05:14.981
<i>Hey, are you on your way back now?</i>

00:05:15.273 --> 00:05:16.483
Uh, yes.

00:05:16.942 --> 00:05:18.485
I'll see you in a few, then.

00:05:31.081 --> 00:05:32.749
Screw this!

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:39.256
Going through sterilization
each time we come back is a real pain.

00:05:40.882 --> 00:05:42.092
That scar...

00:05:42.175 --> 00:05:43.301
This?

00:05:44.261 --> 00:05:46.721
To a soldier, it's just a medal of honor.

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:51.017
There's still a fragment remaining
close to my spinal cord though.

00:05:51.518 --> 00:05:52.519
But, then...

00:05:52.852 --> 00:05:55.522
Yeah, I may die one day.

00:05:56.064 --> 00:05:58.275
But if the surgery went wrong,

00:05:58.358 --> 00:06:01.319
I couldn't even piss on my own.
No, thank you.

00:06:06.199 --> 00:06:07.659
You can't make a vaccine?

00:06:07.993 --> 00:06:08.994
<i>That's right.</i>

00:06:09.786 --> 00:06:11.204
<i>To create a vaccine,</i>

00:06:11.413 --> 00:06:14.583
<i>antibodies are first made</i>
<i>using chicken eggs.</i>

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.335
-Little chicks?
<i>-Yes.</i>

00:06:17.752 --> 00:06:21.047
<i>However,</i>
<i>the Red Death virus is extremely toxic,</i>

00:06:21.464 --> 00:06:24.926
<i>and kills the cells</i>
<i>before antibodies can be made.</i>

00:06:25.343 --> 00:06:26.678
Therefore, it can't be made.

00:06:27.721 --> 00:06:29.097
Isn't there some other way?

00:06:29.598 --> 00:06:31.182
<i>If we could just make the vaccine,</i>

00:06:31.391 --> 00:06:34.477
<i>mass production would be possible</i>
<i>using nano-printers.</i>

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:44.946
Sarge, didn't I tell you
it was freshly cooked?

00:06:45.363 --> 00:06:48.158
But it's best when it's piping hot!

00:06:49.409 --> 00:06:50.744
Yum! It's delicious.

00:06:51.661 --> 00:06:54.205
By the way, Cain, whose photo are you...

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:55.332
Ow!

00:06:55.665 --> 00:06:58.251
What does it matter?
Showing it won't hurt.

00:06:58.877 --> 00:07:00.545
What photo?

00:07:03.798 --> 00:07:05.884
Cain, I give! I give!

00:07:09.888 --> 00:07:12.474
Ow, that... doesn't hurt?!

00:07:13.058 --> 00:07:14.559
Works good, huh?

00:07:14.643 --> 00:07:17.187
What are you hiding, old man?

00:07:17.687 --> 00:07:19.314
I can't help but wonder.

00:07:23.401 --> 00:07:24.611
All right.

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:28.657
Who are they?

00:07:29.157 --> 00:07:31.159
My long lost wife and son.

00:07:31.409 --> 00:07:32.285
Really?

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.958
Cain, you have a family?

00:07:38.667 --> 00:07:40.418
She's my third wife.

00:07:42.379 --> 00:07:44.798
Even someone like you could marry
three times, huh?

00:07:45.423 --> 00:07:47.801
<i>Why have you been showing this around?</i>

00:07:48.802 --> 00:07:52.889
<i>The last time I had contact with them,</i>
<i>they were in Neo Liang.</i>

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:58.895
They could be among the refugees.

00:07:59.354 --> 00:08:00.897
Or they could be dead.

00:08:03.692 --> 00:08:04.859
Family, huh?

00:08:11.241 --> 00:08:13.535
If you run that fast,
you'll trip and fall.

00:08:16.997 --> 00:08:17.956
Son!

00:08:19.124 --> 00:08:21.960
I'm sorry. It's my fault
for not keeping an eye on you.

00:08:30.635 --> 00:08:32.721
Well, it was a long time ago.

00:08:33.304 --> 00:08:36.266
It spoils the mood,
that's why I didn't want to talk about it.

00:08:37.475 --> 00:08:39.853
Come on, let's eat these dumplings.

00:08:48.361 --> 00:08:50.905
<i>Thanks to the reactor's filter effect,</i>
<i>there's a barrier</i>

00:08:51.531 --> 00:08:53.742
<i>around the city that the virus</i>
<i>can't penetrate.</i>

00:08:54.242 --> 00:08:56.453
<i>However, if we allow even one person in...</i>

00:08:57.245 --> 00:09:00.457
On the other hand,
if we don't allow the refugees in,

00:09:00.665 --> 00:09:03.877
we would surely be criticized
by the other absolute-defense cities.

00:09:04.669 --> 00:09:08.214
It's easy to criticize based on ideals
when it doesn't affect you.

00:09:09.299 --> 00:09:11.051
Ideals are quite handy.

00:09:18.725 --> 00:09:20.518
<i>Let us in the city!</i>

00:09:20.935 --> 00:09:22.812
<i>It's already been days!</i>

00:09:23.229 --> 00:09:24.230
<i>Let us in!</i>

00:09:24.564 --> 00:09:26.858
Please! Just my child!

00:09:27.233 --> 00:09:31.488
<i>Unfortunately, at this point in time,</i>
<i>we cannot let you in the city.</i>

00:09:31.988 --> 00:09:33.782
Hey, what's all the commotion?

00:09:34.199 --> 00:09:37.035
Just a little while ago,
the refugees started an uproar.

00:09:37.786 --> 00:09:40.163
Their stress
is beginning to build up, too.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:45.585
But, if this many people begin to revolt,
we'll have no choice but to use weapons.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:49.672
Shut up! If you won't let us in,
we are prepared to fight back!

00:09:49.756 --> 00:09:50.590
Hey!

00:09:50.757 --> 00:09:52.425
Out of the way!

00:09:54.219 --> 00:09:55.386
This is bad.

00:09:55.595 --> 00:09:57.722
If they start to riot,
there's no going back.

00:09:59.224 --> 00:10:01.518
Everyone, it's useless to resist!

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:02.685
Give me that!

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:06.314
Stop! We will shoot!

00:10:11.111 --> 00:10:12.112
<i>Stop this now!</i>

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:16.908
Michael...

00:10:17.242 --> 00:10:19.953
<i>We know better than anyone</i>
<i>what would happen</i>

00:10:20.203 --> 00:10:22.539
<i>if the Red Death found its way</i>
<i>into the city.</i>

00:10:22.831 --> 00:10:24.124
<i>Come to your senses!</i>

00:10:24.624 --> 00:10:27.335
Now is when your humanity
is truly put to the test.

00:10:28.503 --> 00:10:29.504
He's right.

00:10:29.838 --> 00:10:30.839
Michael...

00:10:31.631 --> 00:10:33.591
If that's what Michael says, then...

00:10:33.925 --> 00:10:35.176
Wow.

00:10:35.885 --> 00:10:37.512
Is the leader inside?

00:10:38.138 --> 00:10:39.139
Michael?

00:10:39.973 --> 00:10:41.224
Is that you, Michael?

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:43.059
<i>Do you know who I am?</i>

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:46.646
Cain? Is that you, Cain?

00:10:51.484 --> 00:10:54.571
What is your relationship with Michael?

00:10:54.904 --> 00:10:57.073
We used to be in the same unit.

00:10:57.782 --> 00:10:59.659
That was ten years ago though.

00:11:00.869 --> 00:11:02.912
It's been a while, Michael.

00:11:04.706 --> 00:11:06.124
Hey, Michael!

00:11:06.207 --> 00:11:08.293
Come out and show your face.

00:11:10.503 --> 00:11:12.839
<i>How are Sarah and Reinhard doing?</i>

00:11:13.214 --> 00:11:14.382
Huh?

00:11:15.341 --> 00:11:17.760
We split up shortly after that.

00:11:19.012 --> 00:11:21.389
It's just this once. Forgive me.

00:11:22.265 --> 00:11:25.059
An old friend was taken hostage.

00:11:25.435 --> 00:11:27.103
I can't just abandon him.

00:11:28.021 --> 00:11:31.107
I... I am not strong enough...

00:11:31.524 --> 00:11:33.026
to wait for you forever.

00:11:34.569 --> 00:11:35.862
<i>Oh, that time.</i>

00:11:36.237 --> 00:11:40.283
I saved my friend,
but my family was torn apart.

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:43.745
Just another one of those clichéd
soldier's tales you hear.

00:11:44.078 --> 00:11:46.080
Forget about that.

00:11:46.164 --> 00:11:48.666
Michael, come down out of there.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.627
Let's have a drink together!

00:11:50.877 --> 00:11:52.253
<i>-Stay away!</i>
-Huh?

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:57.175
<i>I've... been infected.</i>

00:11:59.636 --> 00:12:00.511
Michael...

00:12:01.304 --> 00:12:04.057
<i>If I come out, the germs will spread.</i>

00:12:04.766 --> 00:12:07.644
This is the least I can do
to protect the refugees.

00:12:07.977 --> 00:12:09.646
Wa-- Wait!

00:12:09.938 --> 00:12:11.898
Do you have Red Death symptoms?

00:12:12.649 --> 00:12:14.275
What do you mean?

00:12:14.776 --> 00:12:16.319
When did the symptoms start?

00:12:18.529 --> 00:12:20.865
<i>Around a week ago.</i>

00:12:20.949 --> 00:12:21.908
A week?!

00:12:22.158 --> 00:12:24.619
What are you so excited about, Leon?

00:12:25.161 --> 00:12:27.163
<i>Once symptoms appear,</i>
<i>the mortality rate is</i>

00:12:27.246 --> 00:12:29.123
<i>nearly 100% within one hour!</i>

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:30.500
<i>So what?</i>

00:12:30.583 --> 00:12:33.753
<i>Michael's had symptoms</i>
<i>this long and is still living!</i>

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.005
<i>He may have antibodies of some sort.</i>

00:12:36.673 --> 00:12:38.257
We may be able to make a vaccine!

00:12:40.343 --> 00:12:43.262
Michael, please let me take
a blood sample.

00:12:43.721 --> 00:12:46.808
<i>But... I can't come out.</i>

00:12:46.891 --> 00:12:48.351
<i>If I do...</i>

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:52.480
No. I'm sure there's something we can do
to prevent that.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:55.191
What the...

00:13:05.785 --> 00:13:07.078
Michael! What are you...?

00:13:08.121 --> 00:13:09.205
I don't know!

00:13:09.497 --> 00:13:10.790
It's moving on its own!

00:13:10.873 --> 00:13:12.291
<i>That's impossible!</i>

00:13:30.226 --> 00:13:31.936
The MOEV transformed into a BRAI?

00:13:32.937 --> 00:13:33.938
It's a Dark Drive.

00:13:35.815 --> 00:13:37.692
That man is here!

00:13:38.484 --> 00:13:39.402
Where is he?!

00:13:39.819 --> 00:13:42.196
It's showtime!

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:44.490
Let's get started!

00:13:45.158 --> 00:13:46.826
A bloody tragedy.

00:13:47.368 --> 00:13:49.912
An epidemic of death!

00:13:52.248 --> 00:13:54.000
<i>We've got a BRAI on our hands.</i>

00:13:54.459 --> 00:13:57.795
Doug and Queenie,
head out in Pandora Two and Three

00:13:58.421 --> 00:14:00.506
<i>Gren, lead the refugees to shelter!</i>

00:14:00.757 --> 00:14:02.675
-What bad timing.
-<i>Leon, take the wheel!</i>

00:14:03.217 --> 00:14:05.011
Quit whining and get to work!

00:14:05.678 --> 00:14:06.637
Yes, sir!

00:14:13.061 --> 00:14:14.062
Cain!

00:14:17.857 --> 00:14:19.859
Cain! Cain!

00:14:23.905 --> 00:14:27.992
This means I've been infected
with the Red Death, doesn't it?

00:14:30.411 --> 00:14:31.579
Isn't that right?

00:14:33.498 --> 00:14:34.415
All right.

00:14:34.499 --> 00:14:37.126
I'll buy us some time
until Doug and the others get here.

00:14:38.086 --> 00:14:42.090
Be ready to take a blood sample
from Michael at any moment.

00:14:42.423 --> 00:14:43.424
Yes, sir.

00:14:43.883 --> 00:14:44.884
Cain!

00:14:51.307 --> 00:14:53.643
<i>Get out of there now! I'll take over!</i>

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:56.979
What's going on?

00:14:57.355 --> 00:14:59.232
<i>-I can't stop it!</i>
-Michael!

00:15:01.692 --> 00:15:04.904
It's no use!
Blow me and this disease away!

00:15:05.571 --> 00:15:07.281
<i>You know I can't do that!</i>

00:15:12.578 --> 00:15:13.579
Michael...

00:15:15.998 --> 00:15:17.917
He's persistent, for a peon.

00:15:18.501 --> 00:15:20.503
However, he's in the way.

00:15:22.213 --> 00:15:27.427
Didn't Mr. Gold tell you
to obey my orders?

00:15:34.434 --> 00:15:36.269
I can't shoot with the refugees there!

00:15:36.602 --> 00:15:38.521
And its armor is unbeatable!

00:15:39.105 --> 00:15:40.231
Dark Drive...

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:44.318
Michael! No!

00:15:44.944 --> 00:15:49.031
Cain! Kill me! You have to stop me!

00:15:50.158 --> 00:15:52.702
Stop, Michael!

00:15:53.786 --> 00:15:57.290
<i>I believe this pandemic</i>
<i>was deliberately created</i>

00:15:57.582 --> 00:15:59.167
to expand the contaminated area.

00:15:59.667 --> 00:16:02.086
They plan to seal off Neo Xianglong
with the plague

00:16:02.545 --> 00:16:04.172
and isolate it from the world.

00:16:04.755 --> 00:16:07.467
Everyone, run to the hill over there now!

00:16:07.925 --> 00:16:09.093
I will shield you.

00:16:09.886 --> 00:16:13.139
Here I come! For Neo Xianglong!

00:16:15.183 --> 00:16:16.476
What?

00:16:17.059 --> 00:16:18.060
<i>Gren!</i>

00:16:18.311 --> 00:16:19.896
<i>Shit! They got my legs!</i>

00:16:20.313 --> 00:16:23.065
<i>There are people in there!</i>
<i>They'll be used as hostages!</i>

00:16:29.489 --> 00:16:31.032
Michael! Huh?

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:34.160
That's the guy from before.

00:16:35.453 --> 00:16:36.454
What?!

00:16:40.791 --> 00:16:42.210
Damn it!

00:16:47.924 --> 00:16:48.841
This is bad!

00:16:48.925 --> 00:16:50.092
Stop!

00:16:51.427 --> 00:16:52.595
How foolish.

00:17:07.818 --> 00:17:08.903
Well done.

00:17:11.781 --> 00:17:14.450
Doug! Queenie! Use your hyperdrive!

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.994
There's no other way to beat him.

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:18.871
No way...

00:17:18.996 --> 00:17:21.249
But that's the only way!

00:17:22.291 --> 00:17:23.292
Roger!

00:17:53.614 --> 00:17:56.325
Leon! So, this is your answer.

00:17:56.826 --> 00:18:00.997
A Dirac collapse of the Hyperdrive
and multidimensional quantum inductance.

00:18:01.455 --> 00:18:04.584
You incorporated the Ramanujan formula.

00:18:06.502 --> 00:18:10.047
You got it right!
But you're also fundamentally wrong!

00:18:11.591 --> 00:18:15.469
The power of the psyche
is a feeble, childish illusion!

00:18:19.682 --> 00:18:21.809
Sorry, it's my job.

00:18:22.685 --> 00:18:25.855
Sky God Style Ravaging Blade!

00:18:39.243 --> 00:18:40.161
Michael!

00:18:41.662 --> 00:18:43.873
Michael! Hey, Michael!

00:18:44.457 --> 00:18:46.709
No, Cain! Don't touch him.

00:18:48.961 --> 00:18:51.297
I'm sorry... Michael.

00:18:56.969 --> 00:18:58.304
Thanks to you...

00:18:58.929 --> 00:19:00.139
we can save everyone.

00:19:10.316 --> 00:19:11.317
<i>Michael...</i>

00:19:12.234 --> 00:19:13.235
<i>is crying.</i>

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:18.324
<i>I've gathered the necessary data.</i>

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.786
Neo Xianglong...

00:19:22.828 --> 00:19:25.748
I will turn you into a graveyard.

00:19:28.459 --> 00:19:30.378
Fluffy, fluffy!

00:19:30.586 --> 00:19:32.630
That kitty smell!

00:19:32.797 --> 00:19:35.299
Emilia, you reek of kitty!

00:19:36.509 --> 00:19:40.221
We were able to detect antibodies
in the blood sample taken from Michael.

00:19:40.429 --> 00:19:44.600
We should be able to
mass produce the vaccine.

00:19:45.101 --> 00:19:49.689
All the refugees will get vaccinated,
but we can't house them all.

00:19:49.772 --> 00:19:52.233
So only those with symptoms
will be allowed in.

00:19:52.441 --> 00:19:53.859
Fluffy!

00:19:53.943 --> 00:19:55.528
The city will fall into chaos.

00:19:55.736 --> 00:19:58.364
Fluffy, fluffy!

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:06.789
We gave you the vaccine. You'll be fine.

00:20:07.331 --> 00:20:08.207
Yeah...

00:20:08.457 --> 00:20:11.711
All the refugees are
currently being vaccinated.

00:20:12.962 --> 00:20:15.089
This is all thanks to Michael.

00:20:15.673 --> 00:20:17.174
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:20:23.806 --> 00:20:25.808
I hope they arrive safely.

00:20:26.308 --> 00:20:27.309
Yeah...

00:20:27.393 --> 00:20:31.021
But will their destination city
accept them?

00:20:39.196 --> 00:20:40.281
What's wrong?

00:20:42.533 --> 00:20:43.659
<i>Nothing.</i>

00:22:30.766 --> 00:22:31.976
Fiona...

00:22:33.644 --> 00:22:35.646
Coincidence or inevitability?

00:22:36.355 --> 00:22:38.691
Which do you think
this meeting is, Cecile?

00:22:39.233 --> 00:22:40.734
Don't call me that.

00:22:41.527 --> 00:22:42.486
It's just "Princess."

00:22:44.113 --> 00:22:45.114
Princess...

00:22:46.198 --> 00:22:49.201
Cecile, Princess. Princess, Cecile.

00:22:50.077 --> 00:22:53.080
You are both, and yet neither.

00:22:55.374 --> 00:22:57.167
Are you talking about quantum overlap?

00:23:01.589 --> 00:23:07.052
Until we gently hold it within our hands
and observe it, we won't know.

00:23:08.387 --> 00:23:09.513
Is it yours...

00:23:10.639 --> 00:23:11.640
or mine?

00:23:13.225 --> 00:23:16.312
White or black? Zero or one?

00:23:16.729 --> 00:23:19.898
White Chaos or Dark Chaos?

00:23:20.608 --> 00:23:23.444
<i>We have zero information on either.</i>

00:23:24.153 --> 00:23:27.156
<i>When they face in opposition,</i>
<i>information comes to light,</i>

00:23:27.448 --> 00:23:29.325
<i>and everything becomes clear.</i>

00:23:30.743 --> 00:23:33.203
<i>But in a quantum sense,</i>
<i>either is possible.</i>

00:23:34.455 --> 00:23:37.833
Which chaos do you desire...

00:23:40.836 --> 00:23:41.962
elder sister?

00:23:46.759 --> 00:23:49.345
THE CRIES OF CHAOS

00:23:49.428 --> 00:23:50.888
Subtitle translation by Amanda Miller
